  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: $x=4-y^2 \\Rightarrow y^2=-x+4$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/4D559kVr__GLymsb2HcT3JCq_SRk-EIId7j9pwu35MY.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n$x=0 \\Rightarrow y^2=4 \\Rightarrow y= \\pm 2$\nArea bounded by the curve $x=4-y^2$ and $y$-axis is,\n$=2 \\int_0^2 x d y=2 \\int_0^2\\left(4-y^2\\right) d y=2\\left[4 y-\\frac{y^3}{3}\\right]_0^2=2\\left(8-\\frac{8}{3}\\right)=\\frac{32}{3}$ sq. unit",
    "image": null
  },
